 "context": "<figure id=\"fig-ch38_03_03\" class=\" \"><span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp120424160\" data-alt=\"Illustration shows a synovial joint between two bones. An I-beam–shaped synovial cavity exists between the bones, and articular cartilage wraps around the tips of the bones. Ligaments connect the two bones together.\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20210823.155019/resources/774d7d9189659b105ccc3f5eb7812e7eed9a9734\" data-media-type=\"image/jpg\" alt=\"Illustration shows a synovial joint between two bones. An I-beam–shaped synovial cavity exists between the bones, and articular cartilage wraps around the tips of the bones. Ligaments connect the two bones together.\" width=\"295\" id=\"4\">\n</span>\n</figure>",
